ments-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dragon Slayer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Slayer_9866f8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_Trophy_23028d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Tower Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tower_Shield_ea3208.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Goroma Dragon Lair 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"108\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goroma_Dragon_Lair_1_9a3375.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Goroma Dragon Lair 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goroma_Dragon_Lair_2_aa837f.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Goroma Dragon Lair 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"79\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goroma_Dragon_Lair_3_9aa56e.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.8<br/>August 1, 2006<br/>Summer Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The Goroma Dragon Lairs are situated under the volcano of <a href=\"#/wiki/Goroma\">Goroma</a>. Here you will have the opportunity to fight <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elementals</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devils</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>. You can also find a few <a href=\"#/wiki/Lavahole\">Lavaholes</a> in this area.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hunting_Strategies\">Hunting Strategies</span></h2>\n<p>Any vocation should be experienced in hunting strong monsters. If you go in a party it is adviced to have an <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Elite Knight</a> to block it all for a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">MS</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">ED</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">RP</a>. You can also take a good mage who can block creatures like <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a>.\n</p><p>As usual druids and sorcerers will use <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Strike\">Ice Strikes</a>, Avalanches or <a href=\"#/wiki/Icicle%20Rune\">Icicles</a>. Paladins can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Missile\">Divine Missile</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">Power Bolts</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Arrow\">Onyx Arrows</a> or even Enchanted- or Royal Spears. <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a> just take <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potions</a> in case you need them.\n</p><p>Dragons are skinnable so a useful tool to have would be an <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Knife\">Obsidian Knife</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Skinning\">obtain</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Leather\">red</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">green</a> dragon leathers. Also for low level Mages and Paladins it is advisable to use <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a> in case the dragon retargets. Knights should also remember to use <a href=\"#/wiki/Challenge\">Challenge</a> to avoid the monsters retargeting on other members of their team.\n</p><p>This place is also very suitable to hunt solo for e.g. knights from level 80 or higher.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Route\">Route</span></h2>\n<p>There are two ways to reach the lairs. Either enter the path via the volcano then walk east instead of west (<a href=\"#/wiki/Ramoa\">Ramoa</a>) or you go via Ramoa to exactly the same location and take the right path.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\"><img alt=\"Fire Devil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Devil_3b556a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Devil\">Fire Devil</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">145</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">180 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">35 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">145 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Small Pitchfork (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scimitar\">Scimitar</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necrotic%20Rod\">Necrotic Rod</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cleaver\">Cleaver</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Guardian Shield (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\"><img alt=\"Fire Elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Elemental_52695e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Elemental\">Fire Elemental</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">220</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">280</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">280 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">180 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table no-results\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>This creature drops no loot.</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\"><img alt=\"Dragon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_24987b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragon</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">430 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">310 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-105× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Shield\">Steel Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crossbow\">Crossbow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dragon's Tail (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Burst%20Arrow\">Burst Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Longsword\">Longsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Steel%20Helmet\">Steel Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Legs\">Plate Legs</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Leather\">Green Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Dragon%20Scale\">Green Dragon Scale</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Double%20Axe\">Double Axe</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Hammer (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Serpent%20Sword\">Serpent Sword</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Diamond\">Small Diamond</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Shield\">Dragon Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dragonbone Staff (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Trophy\">Dragon Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\"><img alt=\"Dragon Lord\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Lord_c599c2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lord</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">670 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">230 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">440 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-245× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Ham\">Dragon Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Book%20%28Gemmed%29\">Book (Gemmed)</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× Royal Spear (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-7× <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">Power Bolt</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Ring\">Energy Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Sapphire\">Small Sapphire</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Golden%20Mug\">Golden Mug</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Scale\">Red Dragon Scale</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Dragon%20Leather\">Red Dragon Leather</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Crystal\">Life Crystal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Strange Helmet (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Sword\">Fire Sword</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Royal%20Helmet\">Royal Helmet</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tower%20Shield\">Tower Shield</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Scale%20Mail\">Dragon Scale Mail</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord%20Trophy\">Dragon Lord Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dragon Slayer (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>There are ~10 Fire Devils, ~25 Fire Elementals, ~25 Dragons and ~5 Dragon Lords.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Maps\">Maps</span></h2>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"67d94a5d420e034e19612ca83c51d811\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goroma_Dragon_Lair_1-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:160px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"first floor\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"first floor\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goroma_Dragon_Lair_1_9a3375.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goroma Dragon Lair 1.png (8 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">first floor</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goroma_Dragon_Lair_2-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:154px; width:185px; top:3px;\"><img alt=\"second floor\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"second floor\" height=\"160\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goroma_Dragon_Lair_2_aa837f.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goroma Dragon Lair 2.png (8 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">second floor</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:162px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goroma_Dragon_Lair_3-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:87px; width:140px; top:36.5px;\"><img alt=\"third floor\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"third floor\" height=\"88\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goroma_Dragon_Lair_3_9aa56e.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goroma Dragon Lair 3.png (2 KB)\" width=\"140\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">third floor</div></div></div></div>","quests":[]}